<figure class="standard-diagram">
  <svg
    xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
    viewBox="0 0 960 330"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="rdr-recursion-title rdr-recursion-desc"
  >
    <title id="rdr-recursion-title">
      The recursion STD-07 exists to interrupt
    </title>
    <desc id="rdr-recursion-desc">
      Four stages run left to right: conditions justify the delegation, the
      system succeeds, the institution reorganizes around it, and expertise and
      alternatives recede. A return path carries that last stage back to the
      first, showing that the conditions which justified the delegation have
      been altered by the delegation itself.
    </desc>

    <style>
      .ink {
        fill: var(--text, #1f2937);
      }
      .muted {
        fill: var(--muted, #6b7280);
      }
      .line {
        stroke: var(--border, #374151);
        stroke-width: 2;
        fill: none;
        stroke-linecap: round;
        stroke-linejoin: round;
      }
      .line-strong {
        stroke: var(--border, #374151);
        stroke-width: 3.5;
        fill: none;
        stroke-linecap: round;
        stroke-linejoin: round;
      }
      .band-a {
        fill: var(--surface, #f8fafc);
      }
      .chip {
        fill: var(--surface, #ffffff);
        stroke: var(--border, #374151);
        stroke-width: 2;
      }
      .fill-border {
        fill: var(--border, #374151);
      }
      .chip-state {
        rx: 10;
        ry: 10;
      }
      .chip-badge {
        rx: 8;
        ry: 8;
      }
      .small {
        font:
          500 11px ui-sans-serif,
          system-ui,
          -apple-system,
          Segoe UI,
          Roboto;
      }
      .label {
        font:
          600 12.5px ui-sans-serif,
          system-ui,
          -apple-system,
          Segoe UI,
          Roboto;
      }
      .title {
        font:
          650 14px ui-sans-serif,
          system-ui,
          -apple-system,
          Segoe UI,
          Roboto;
      }
    </style>

    <rect x="24" y="52" width="912" height="104" class="band-a" rx="14"></rect>
    <text x="40" y="40" class="title ink"
      >The delegation alters its own premise</text
    >

    <rect x="44" y="84" width="196" height="48" class="chip chip-state"></rect>
    <text x="142" y="103" text-anchor="middle" class="label ink"
      >Conditions justify</text
    >
    <text x="142" y="120" text-anchor="middle" class="label ink"
      >the delegation</text
    >

    <line x1="240" y1="108" x2="258" y2="108" class="line"></line>
    <path d="M272 108 L258 101 L258 115 Z" class="fill-border"></path>

    <rect x="272" y="84" width="170" height="48" class="chip chip-state"></rect>
    <text x="357" y="103" text-anchor="middle" class="label ink"
      >The system</text
    >
    <text x="357" y="120" text-anchor="middle" class="label ink">succeeds</text>

    <line x1="442" y1="108" x2="460" y2="108" class="line"></line>
    <path d="M474 108 L460 101 L460 115 Z" class="fill-border"></path>

    <rect x="474" y="84" width="186" height="48" class="chip chip-state"></rect>
    <text x="567" y="103" text-anchor="middle" class="label ink"
      >The institution</text
    >
    <text x="567" y="120" text-anchor="middle" class="label ink"
      >reorganizes</text
    >

    <line x1="660" y1="108" x2="678" y2="108" class="line"></line>
    <path d="M692 108 L678 101 L678 115 Z" class="fill-border"></path>

    <rect x="692" y="84" width="224" height="48" class="chip chip-state"></rect>
    <text x="804" y="103" text-anchor="middle" class="label ink"
      >Expertise and alternatives</text
    >
    <text x="804" y="120" text-anchor="middle" class="label ink">recede</text>

    <path
      d="M804 132 L804 200 Q804 220 784 220 L162 220 Q142 220 142 200 L142 140"
      class="line-strong"></path>
    <path d="M142 128 L135 142 L149 142 Z" class="fill-border"></path>

    <rect x="372" y="206" width="216" height="28" class="chip chip-badge"
    ></rect>
    <text x="480" y="225" text-anchor="middle" class="label ink"
      >the premise has changed</text
    >

    <text x="480" y="262" text-anchor="middle" class="label ink">
      What justified the delegation is gone. The delegation remains.
    </text>

    <text x="40" y="296" class="small muted">
      Recorded, this is detectable: a belief carries as_of and available_at, an
      authorization carries depends_on and revocation conditions, and
    </text>
    <text x="40" y="312" class="small muted">
      invalidated_by names what would end it. Unrecorded, the erosion is real
      and invisible, which is the condition STD-07 is written against.
    </text>
  </svg>
</figure>
